flowchart TD
  LAUNCH[Open iOS-style phone simulator within the React web app] --> SYNC[Load selected Case ID from shared web context]
  SYNC --> HOME[Mobile Home - case summary and status]
  HOME --> CASES[Cases - same persisted case data]
  CASES --> DETAIL[Case Detail - requirements, state and timeline]

  subgraph MOBILE[Phone-sized presentation - visual iOS patterns, not a native app]
    DETAIL --> TABS{Choose a case view}
    TABS -->|Agent Activity| AGENT[Agent Progress - persisted events and checkpoints]
    TABS -->|Verified Plan| PLAN[Verified Offer - price, currency, version, evidence summary]
    TABS -->|Review| REVIEW[Approval Review - pending decision and terms]
    TABS -->|Result| RESULT[Result - backend-confirmed mock order or rejection]
    HOME --> ALERTS[In-app status notices - derived from polling]
    ALERTS --> DETAIL
  end

  PLAN --> REVIEW
  REVIEW --> READY{Approval is pending and snapshot is current?}
  READY -->|No| STALE[Show stale, missing or already-decided state; disable actions]
  READY -->|Yes| ACTION{User decision}
  ACTION -->|Approve| CONFIRM[Explicit confirmation of selected offer, version and amount]
  ACTION -->|Reject| REJECT[Submit reject decision]
  CONFIRM --> POST[POST decision with approval ID, nonce and state version]
  REJECT --> POST
  POST --> WAIT[Show submitting state and poll REST API]
  WAIT --> SERVER{What does the persisted backend report?}
  SERVER -->|Accepted and completed| RESULT
  SERVER -->|Rejected| RESULT
  SERVER -->|Stale or invalid| STALE
  SERVER -->|Still processing| WAIT
  STALE --> DETAIL
  AGENT --> DETAIL
  RESULT --> DETAIL

  NOTE[One demo actor; one shared Case ID; same FastAPI and PostgreSQL as desktop]
  NOTE -.-> SYNC
  SCOPE[iOS-inspired styling only: no native Face ID, push notifications, payment or real booking]
  SCOPE -.-> HOME

  classDef page fill:#edf3ff,stroke:#477bd4,color:#1b3d73
  classDef action fill:#e9f8f0,stroke:#2a8a63,color:#174d37
  classDef caution fill:#fff0e9,stroke:#d08458,color:#743b21
  class LAUNCH,HOME,CASES,DETAIL,AGENT,PLAN,REVIEW,RESULT,ALERTS page
  class CONFIRM,POST,REJECT,WAIT action
  class STALE,NOTE,SCOPE caution
